                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Nice little indie RPG and I'd say is worth the price tag as long as you don't go into it expecting Diablo 4 or Dragon Age Origins.  It's a fine little indie RPG and I found it pretty fun.\n\nI'd love to see the developer add a use for the right mouse button in the form of a quick side jump or roll to dodge or heck just make it use an equipped shield to block attacks.  \n\nI found a few more little issues nitpicking about minor potential exploits some players may use and my first experience can be best seen by watching this video:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q8meP0uFCZc&feature=youtu.be\n\nI give the game an overall 8 out of 10 and say it's worth the price of admission.  \n\n* I want to thank the developer for the free evaluation key, but understand that free Steam keys NEVER alter my opinion or score of any game.",
